WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
The spring holds the fence just above the blue wheels.

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.292
The trigger lets the fence drop. A wheel rim stops it and the spring lifts it again.

00:00:03.292 --> 00:00:04.792
A gate is under the fence, but there’s still a gap between the fence and the wheels.

00:00:04.792 --> 00:00:06.417
The fence drops a little farther this time. Another wheel still holds it up.

00:00:06.417 --> 00:00:07.917
All three gates are in position. The spring still holds the fence above them.

00:00:07.917 --> 00:00:09.000
The trigger releases the fence. This time the lever nose reaches the cam pocket.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:09.500
The cam pulls back the bolt.
